## Verification and next boundary

All 240 parser rows were matched one-to-one against the 240 source bullet lines, in order, with exact original-label agreement. Counts were recomputed with and without source-label depletion filtering. The source hash is recorded above for a post-write unchanged-source check.

Inventory parsing is complete; the 30 mL formula is not constructed by this report. Before exact mass-based dosing or release, confirm the relevant stock fraction basis/density and supplier safety documentation. In particular, 10% Sambac in DPG must not be silently treated as 10% v/v. This report does not establish that any combination will remove or perceptually suppress Sambac's indolic drydown.
